{"unit_id":"menglian001__dsh-token-usage#card-zh","repo":"menglian001/dsh-token-usage","commit":"131fc31e5b8e22a5c79f60df792444ef30d908cf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-usage 是面向 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）Web GUI 的 token 用量面板。Host 端把每次模型请求的用量折叠成会话请求日志，并将记录追加到本地 JSONL 账本；Web 端在设置页、侧边栏和主面板提供统一入口。面板展示请求数、token 分桶、缓存命中率、输出速度、趋势图、全年热力图和渠道排行，也支持请求明细筛选、分组、下钻与 CSV 导出。账本会在启动时回扫会话历史，帮助保留超过会话投影窗口的统计。适合需要在 DSH 网页界面查看和追踪模型用量的用户；无需 API Key，账本保存在本机 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:371-407","index.js:1114-1193","client.js:3988-4016"]}
{"unit_id":"menglian001__dsh-token-usage#card-en","repo":"menglian001/dsh-token-usage","commit":"131fc31e5b8e22a5c79f60df792444ef30d908cf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-token-usage adds a usage panel to the DSH Web GUI. It stores request token buckets in a local JSONL ledger and shows counts, cache hit rate, trends, a yearly heat map, and channel rankings. Users can filter and export requests. Startup sweeps restore history; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:371-407","index.js:1114-1193","client.js:3988-4016"]}
