{"unit_id":"menglian001__dsh-token-usage#caveat-1","repo":"menglian001/dsh-token-usage","commit":"131fc31e5b8e22a5c79f60df792444ef30d908cf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-usage 使用前须知：用量账本写入本机 DSH_HOME/token-usage/requests.jsonl；未设置 DSH_HOME 时默认使用 ~/.dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:435-438","index.js:1117"]}
